ONE RULE THAT SAVES YOU AN HOUR

Trim your raw footage before you hand it over. Cut the false starts, the dead air at the top, the part where you cough. Claude will cut silences and cover the stretches where you look away from camera, but it cannot know which of your four takes of a line is the good one. That judgement stays yours.


