2.5  Four things worth knowing on day one
The terminal pane
Press Ctrl + ` to open a terminal inside the app. It opens in your project folder and shares the same environment Claude uses. This is where you will paste the install commands in Part 4 — inside the app, not in a separate terminal app.

@ to point at a file
