4. Build the graphics in Remotion. Use anatomy for anything that

   explains how something works.

5. Sound-design it with earshot — a cue on every cut, every element

   that lands, and every type-on.

6. Render 1080x1920, 30fps, H.264, CRF 16, AAC 320k, and limit the

   audio so it never clips.

 

HOW TO WORK

- Show me one still of the hook before you render anything.

- Tell me the look-away timestamps you found before you build over them.

- Two or three effects for the whole reel, not more.

- When I ask for a change, change only that and keep the rest exactly.


If you made the CLAUDE.md file in Part 5.10, most of this is already on file and you can cut the prompt down to the short version below.

